        <body>
            <div xml:id="d776">

                <pb facs="0881" n="769" xml:id="pg769"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.6581/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Counselor of Legation in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Peck</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-01-22T13:00:00+08:00">January 22, 1935—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received January 22—7:26 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7. An unofficial but apparently entirely reliable report has been received that
                    the Chinese Government has almost completed a scheme for a government sugar
                    monopoly and that it will be announced in the near future.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Legation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Peck</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
